iler":false,"text":"最近は引退を考え始め、新人冒険者への指導も行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お酒は好きなのに、お酒に弱い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"酔うと絡み、泣き、笑いと多彩な変化を見せてくれるが、迷惑なのは変わらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「このコスチューム…… そろそろ引退かな」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29898"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d95b3d41717012806e4a86e6dddce36122e2cb5b6e09db8fa7d2000eea96bf48.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4b7856012e6ed6f6c7c5e76c73263b880dd8b11441212d622e47753ec297cd6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"新堂真弓","creatorId":"vndb:s1427","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1427","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1427","name":"新堂 真弓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:122762:29898:6166:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c41608","characterName":"ギン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29899","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"122762"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5607"],"vndbCharacterId":"c41608"},"originalCharacterName":"ギン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist. A traveling magician, unemployed and looking for a job. But upon protecting a group of merchants from bandits, he gets a store deed as a reward. Thus begins Gin's new life as a store owner."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He opens a shop in a land ridden by monsters, hoping to monopolize the adventures. To make his shop prosperous, he'll have to enlist help from various people that he comes across."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's Arute husband. Curiously he has permission from his wife (Arute) to have sex with other women."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41608"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勤め先をクビになり、就職活動をするも上手くいかず放浪の旅をしていた元魔法使い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"山賊に襲われている商人を助けた事により、店の権利書を手に入れ、新しい人生を歩み始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お店では店長兼、料理人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"就職活動をもうしたくないので、お店を絶対に成功させる意気込みだけはある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、トラブルメーカー体質らしく、色々なトラブルが彼の元に引き寄せられるようにやってくる事に。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5607","sourceWorkId":"21202","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勤め先をクビになり、就職活動も上手くいかず、放浪の旅をしていた 元魔法使い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日 山賊に襲われていた商人を助けたところ、そのお礼にと “店の権利書” をもらう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこで自分の店を立ち上げ、新しい人生を歩み始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もう就職活動はしたくないので、お店を絶対に成功させるという意気込みだけはある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがトラブルメーカー体質で、彼のもとにはトラブルが引き寄せられるようにやってくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29899"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/2021462a23123505ce1bd885242bafa87755cc0780b9bc452ab64d0cc7c434a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84cabbefd308004f4210e6d1dd066c9289c3890c1a94dd2a78b18ab65e0d1434.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41678","characterName":"バルガ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41678"},"originalCharacterName":"バルガ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The boss of the local dungeon close to Kaste."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41678"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7abd5ec81a8bab278a63eb752d4c1f3c1b3ba6c5ab9ad0dd29a76526e98de1eb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-